Z||000003||isthiswhereiputausername?||12-14-2001||09:15 AM||||Do you have the setup files or just the programs themselves?  If you dont have the installers, you might as well delete them and redownload them (although that would be illegal, but who cares?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)  because without the origional install program the programs wouldnt work anyways because of not having the dlls or registry entries..<P>You also might want to follow Bills advice and use partition magic and create a backup section on your hd.<P>or check around, maybe someone has a usb burner they can burn off a backup cd for you<BR>(or maybe a computer store will do it cheaply for you)<P>||||reg||1
